 # Changelog
 
+## [v0.1.38-test.1] - 2026-11-26
+
+> R51 receiver-scoped E2LB fallback isolation. This prevents missing receiver bindings from sharing persistent A/B state; it does not claim to fix the E2LB vehicle connection.
+
+### English
+- Persist the E2LB 0x4300 SINGLE_GROUP fallback only when the receiver has a validated, stable app-private HMAC binding.
+- Do not read or write per-receiver fallback state when the receiver configuration store is not ready or the binding is missing/malformed; keep the explicitly selected wire shape for the current attempt.
+- Validate persisted E2LB fingerprint keys before using them as SharedPreferences keys.
+- Add regression tests for missing, malformed, and distinct receiver bindings.
+- Validation: 10 focused `ReceiverFingerprint` / E2LB fallback-policy test methods and 1 SharedPreferences persistence/reset harness check passed; `git diff --check` passed. The Gradle gate could not start because `services.gradle.org` DNS resolution failed; no Android SDK is configured.
+- Full Android build and real-vehicle behavior remain unverified.
+
+### 简体中文
+- 只有取得经过格式校验的本机 HMAC 接收端实例绑定，才持久化 E2LB 0x4300 的 SINGLE_GROUP 自动回退。
+- 接收端配置存储尚未就绪、绑定缺失或格式错误时，不读取或写入按车机隔离的回退状态；本轮仍遵循用户明确选择的报文形态。
+- 使用 SharedPreferences 前校验 E2LB 指纹键格式。
+- 新增接收端绑定缺失、畸形及不同实例隔离的回归测试。
+- 完整 Android 编译与实车行为仍未验证。
+
 ## [v0.1.37-test.1] - 2026-11-26
 
 > R50 E2LB 0x4300 A/B recovery candidate. The automatic fallback is triggered only by a written DUAL_GROUP request followed by a peer-initiated iAP2 restart before 0x4301; it does not prove causation or claim a vehicle fix.
